        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "\nFirst let of stylish fully fitted apartment located within walking distance from commuter train station and with access to private residents' services amenity (Gym, Work Pods).\n\nShackleton Glebe offers a choice of brand new one- and two-bedroom apartments on the edge of historic Lucan Village, Co Dublin, close to an abundance of schools, retail outlets and leisure activities. \n\nThe development is located a short distance from the junction of the M50, N4 and N7, providing quick and easy access to locations around Dublin and beyond. The city centre is approximately 13km away and the airport is accessible along the M50. The superb transport links to Dublin City Centre and beyond makes for a very easy and short commute.\n\nThese brand new spacious apartments are elegantly designed with high end interior fit outs, floor to ceiling window in the kitchen / living room, fully kitted kitchens with all modern appliances, large bedrooms and ensuite bathrooms. Some of their features include:\n\n• Fully fitted kitchens with modern appliances \n• Dining and living area\n• Brand new modern bathrooms with bath and shower\n• Large bright bedrooms with built in wardrobes \n• Excellent storage space throughout. \n• Energy-efficient apartments that are comfortable and cost-effective to run. \n\nAmenities at Shackleton Glebe will include; \n• 260sqm. of resident amenity Space\n• Work-From-Home private and semi-private pods\n• Full beginner-to-advanced Gym with treadmills, concept-2 rowers, spin bikes, free weights, weightlifting rack, high-spec flooring, and changing rooms + lockers\n• Community Dining Area\n• Outdoor Picnic Area\n• Indoor and outdoor leisure space\n• Coffee and Tea doc\n• Fully automated virtual concierge service\n\n **Please note the internal photos may not be of the actual apartment but are representative of the standard of finish**\n\n*** Please note there are multiple property types available in this development.\nThe rent advertised on the individual property ads represent the starting rent for these property types.\nRents will vary throughout the development depending on the specific property type. Not all the available properties and rents listed here; please use those available at viewings."
